[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "text": "Master..."
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "It's been a long time."
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "Shinobu?"
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "How did-- "
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "Wait, what'd you say?"
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "Did you call me Master?"
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "I don't have time for apprentices!"
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "You have any idea how much pro-wrestling"
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "is backlogged on my VCR?"
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "I came to tell you "
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": "I got back safely from Asia."
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "You should be happy."
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "I didn't even know you left!"
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "Are you listening?"
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "I'm not your Master!"
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "My only desire was to become "
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "strong like you, Master."
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "So I trained hard, and fought to"
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "become the champion of Asia."
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "Here's my belt."
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "No way..."
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "You won this?"
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": "That's pretty bad ass."
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "text": "I was told the competition was "
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "text": "heating up in Santa Destroy,"
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "text": "and my Master was over-burdened."
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "text": "Me over-burdened?"
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "text": "Who told you that?"
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "text": "Sylvia. She said I should "
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "text": "come back and help you."
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "text": "What?! Who's that bitch "
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "text": "think she is, my nanny?!"
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "text": "Listen up, Shinobu."
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "text": "This is my war."
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "text": "I don't need help from anybody!"
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "text": " Well, the thing is..."
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "text": "It's kinda too late for that."
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "text": "What are you talking about?"
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "text": "I'll explain later, Master..."
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "text": "But you should go to the "
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "text": "bathroom first."
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "text": "Seriously, it's a long story."
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "text": "Fine."
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "text": "But I'm not your god damn Master!"
  }
]